# Phase 10.5 final UI golden manifest: original recordings head 1c85a8f375b5c76d817abd06ab25a843e384f868.
# dashboard.png was re-reviewed after exact-head parallel runners exposed a lifecycle-order race in the roster-ready card. The fixture preserves all 15 persisted players but makes the integer readiness average identical (93%) for the valid transient 11-starter emission and the complete 15-player roster; the test still requires the complete persisted roster before capture. This removes timing-only pixels without weakening roster validation.
# dashboard.png was re-reviewed again on 0a9303075a6a9dcd9289f359110a292676821d2e after later certified Dashboard/season-boundary changes made the 2026-08-22 hash stale. The captured frame was explicitly inspected from Actions artifact 9916040630; it is the stable career QA dashboard and no market-value patch touches Dashboard rendering.
# finances.png was re-reviewed on cbe38e50f5ba82d314bcdf4a9b7b13417dd2bd10 after two deterministic renders showed the original retained a transient Market-tab interaction background; the stable Finance-selected frame is pinned below.
# standings.png was re-reviewed on bbf4ab88948dca9fc52e4fb53829ed047e2de16d after the capture harness explicitly drained Material indication time; the original baseline likewise retained the previous Market-tab interaction background instead of the stable Standings-selected frame.
